      "content": "idk i dont want to call the doctor for something small like this lol. i feel like the jitters are just because my thyroid is acting up and the adderall is just hitting harder right now. do you think it's actually dangerous or is it just like normal side effects? i really need my focus for work so i dont want to stop taking it.",
